# Claims the `Quickshell` module URI for the shim's C++ types. Omarchy installs
# the real Quickshell into Qt's own qml directory, and a module found on the
# import path wins over C++ registration alone -- the engine would then look
# for that module's plugin and fail. Naming no plugin here leaves the types to
# omaweb::quickshell::installShim().
module Quickshell
